 "ssr": "<div data-screen-label=\"Listing verified\" class=\"tcf-screen\"><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;padding:96px 56px 110px;min-height:52vh\"><div style=\"max-width:780px;margin:0 auto\"><div data-tcf-receipt-state=\"checking\" role=\"status\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652\">Checking your submission&hellip;</p></div><div data-tcf-receipt-state=\"ok\" style=\"display:none\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Listing verification received</div><h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 48px/1.1 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;text-wrap:balance\">Thank you for verifying your school!</h1><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652\">We&rsquo;ve received your listing details for review. You can now create your free school profile page, where prospective students can learn more about your school, course options, and student support.</p><a href=\"/create-your-school-profile/\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border:1.5px solid #95AB3B;align-self:flex-start\" data-hv=\"4\">Create Your School Profile<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A6E78\">Creating a profile is optional and free. We review every submission before your listing changes or a profile is published, and we&rsquo;ve emailed these steps to you<span data-tcf-receipt-school=\"\"></span>.</p></div></div><div data-tcf-receipt-state=\"none\" style=\"display:none\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Listing verification</div><h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 48px/1.1 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;text-wrap:balance\">We couldn&rsquo;t find a recent submission</h1><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652\">This page confirms a listing verification once it has been saved. To verify or update your school&rsquo;s listing, please use the form.</p><a href=\"/provider-application/\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border:1.5px solid #95AB3B;align-self:flex-start\" data-hv=\"4\">Verify your listing<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div><script>(function(){var q=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get(\"receipt\")||\"\";function show(s){[].forEach.call(document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-tcf-receipt-state]\"),function(e){e.style.display=e.getAttribute(\"data-tcf-receipt-state\")===s?\"\":\"none\";});}if(!/^[A-Za-z0-9]{10,64}$/.test(q)){show(\"none\");return;}fetch(\"/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?action=tcfd_listing_receipt&receipt=\"+encodeURIComponent(q),{credentials:\"same-origin\",cache:\"no-store\"}).then(function(r){return r.json();}).then(function(j){if(j&&j.success){var n=j.data&&j.data.school;if(n){var el=document.querySelector(\"[data-tcf-receipt-school]\");el.textContent=\" (submission for \"+n+\")\";}show(\"ok\");}else show(\"none\");}).catch(function(){show(\"none\");});})();</script>",
